                <pb facs="0337" n="241" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg241"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Extract from the Athens Regenerator, May</hi>
                    6.</head>
                <p>As it is known that Takos Arbanitake is actually in the neighborhood of Larissa,
                    (Thessaly,) with a band of 60—that is, in the very neighborhood of the
                    boundaries—our government ought (and we trust it has already done so) to take
                    timely measures and issue proper orders to those charged with the protection of
                    our frontiers, in order to guard against a possible inroad of this band.</p>
            </div>
